#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:1
#: 86c1f79fc290477390d1fb6d30e8b8d3
msgid "用一条流程学会 Make Dataset 卡片系统"
msgstr "Learn the Make Dataset Card System with One Workflow"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:3
#: 6e9ae79192b142ad99a4ac2bf8e993f8
msgid ""
"这不是四张卡片的功能介绍，而是一个完整的工作流示例。目标是从 2 原子的 Si "
"晶胞出发，同时生成掺杂和空位两类候选，再做小幅扰动和几何筛选。走完一次后，你应该能看懂卡片顺序、`Card Group` "
"分支、启停状态、输入输出数量以及流程复用方式。"
msgstr ""
"This is not a feature tour of four separate cards. It is one complete "
"workflow: start from a two-atom Si cell, generate doped and vacancy "
"candidates in parallel, then apply a small perturbation and a geometry "
"filter. After completing it once, you should understand card order, `Card"
" Group` branches, enabled states, input/output counts, and workflow "
"reuse."

