#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:25
#: 39897be7377a4488a0acf85a1a15ba9a
msgid "拖动卡片标题栏可以调整顺序。改完顺序必须重新运行，因为顶层卡片的输出会依次传给下一张已启用卡片。"
msgstr ""
"Drag a card by its title bar to change the order. Run the workflow again "
"after reordering because each top-level card passes its output to the "
"next enabled card."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:27
#: 1963c894ae574ead80990b926937ce4c
msgid "组装这个例子"
msgstr "Build the Example"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:29
#: 972a0ba63b144083a9f5d8416f49a420
msgid "用左上角 `Load` 导入 `Si2.vasp`。"
msgstr "Use `Load` in the upper-left corner to import `Si2.vasp`."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:30
#: fcaa2b37b2f5493aa465c669e0b946ce
msgid ""
"用 `Add new card` 或 `Find card` 依次添加 `Super Cell`、`Card Group`、`Random "
"Doping`、`Vacancy Defect`、`Atomic Perturb` 和 `Geometry Filter`。新卡片先出现在顶层。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Add new card` or `Find card` to add `Super Cell`, `Card Group`, `Random Doping`, "
"`Vacancy Defect`, `Atomic Perturb`, and `Geometry Filter` in that order. New cards first "
"appear at the top level."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:31
#: 5f054d3dde794ed5a215824e8a4e4403
msgid ""
"按住 `Random Doping` 的标题栏，把它拖进 `Card Group` 的空白区域；再用同样方法拖入 `Vacancy "
"Defect`。拖错时，把子卡片拖回工作区空白处即可回到顶层。"
msgstr ""
"Drag `Random Doping` by its title bar into the empty area of `Card Group`, then do the "
"same with `Vacancy Defect`. If a card is grouped by mistake, drag it back to an empty "
"area of the workspace to return it to the top level."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:32
#: b22fcff548b946baa85fe8d423d32ffc
msgid "拖动标题栏，把剩余顶层卡片排成下面的顺序，再填写参数。"
msgstr "Drag the title bars to arrange the remaining top-level cards as shown below, then enter the parameters."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:34
#: f283bce5df854b0cbb2d26583efd2edc
msgid ""
"Super Cell\n"
"→ Card Group [Random Doping | Vacancy Defect]\n"
"→ Atomic Perturb\n"
"→ Geometry Filter\n"
msgstr ""
"Super Cell\n"
"→ Card Group [Random Doping | Vacancy Defect]\n"
"→ Atomic Perturb\n"
"→ Geometry Filter\n"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 62a45a181e5e46aa94e735e17dffd22e
msgid "包含线性步骤和并行分支的完整卡片流程"
msgstr "A complete card workflow with sequential steps and parallel branches"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 62a45a181e5e46aa94e735e17dffd22e
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_workflow.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_workflow.png"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:46
#: 317b028983ce44d3bc2f61c7dd7c5b1f
msgid ""
"顶部按钮控制整条流程：`Copy JSON` 复制当前全部卡片，`Paste JSON` 把剪贴板中的配置追加到现有流程，`Run` "
"运行所有已启用卡片，`Stop` 中止正在运行的卡片。标题栏里的 `Copy JSON` 只复制单张卡片，两者不要混用。"
msgstr ""
"The top controls operate on the whole workflow: `Copy JSON` copies all current cards, "
"`Paste JSON` appends clipboard configuration to the existing workflow, `Run` executes all "
"enabled cards, and `Stop` aborts the running cards. `Copy JSON` in a card title bar copies "
"only that card, so do not confuse the two."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:48
#: 4d4b2429acc74d9eb9746b0cdd5907f4
msgid "本例使用的参数只用于把数据流讲清楚："
msgstr "These parameters are chosen only to make the data flow easy to follow:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 0b6c0b8a184f4460845a42191943fa13
msgid "步骤"
msgstr "Step"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 1cf10182459f4de19c1bd7c03b6fa25a
msgid "关键输入"
msgstr "Key settings"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 769bca415ac54807bcf961438e496062
msgid "预期输出"
msgstr "Expected output"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 26267bde6c9648939d2e0e22b6a9a7a3
msgid "`Super Cell`"
msgstr "`Super Cell`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 792b30bb94d34fbba132c6bc84a55ce3
msgid "`2 × 2 × 2`"
msgstr "`2 × 2 × 2`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 57843c0021f843bca0229b5d38cd6f43
msgid "1 个 16 原子 Si 超胞"
msgstr "One 16-atom Si supercell"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 9c26e5bb021e466b8dd48ac18f7a974c
msgid "`Random Doping`"
msgstr "`Random Doping`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 0968cdde5f1c4c32bea6dad3c19360eb
msgid "目标 `Si`；掺杂元素直接填 `Ge`；固定替换 1 个；生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr ""
"Target `Si`; enter `Ge` directly as the dopant; replace exactly 1 atom; "
"generate 2 structures; seed `42`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 0ed4fbcbd87b4e2b99c830317c4c1cee
msgid "2 个 `Si15Ge`"
msgstr "Two `Si15Ge` structures"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: c2345dd5a8094f77a9ce4bb92293393d
msgid "`Vacancy Defect`"
msgstr "`Vacancy Defect`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: d51aee1bed3444efaee2de61f3cd0aa7
msgid "固定移除 1 个原子；生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr "Remove exactly 1 atom; generate 2 structures; seed `42`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: a3fecccae25a446a8360274bc84fe6fd
msgid "2 个 15 原子 Si 空位结构"
msgstr "Two 15-atom Si vacancy structures"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: a5e245a18a614f40a038ad1c96654e7c
msgid "`Atomic Perturb`"
msgstr "`Atomic Perturb`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: f9d24aa1845a464e889c8b8ed1ec3ff1
msgid "最大位移 `0.05 Å`；每个输入生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr "Maximum displacement `0.05 Å`; generate 2 structures per input; seed `42`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 891e1595ec5b4529afed275d35741179
msgid "$4\\times2=8$ 个扰动结构"
msgstr "$4\\times2=8$ perturbed structures"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: f72a4cd7676f450a93d99d66e85c55f3
msgid "`Geometry Filter`"
msgstr "`Geometry Filter`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 3f1682c9c8f94c2198b4ef6934dd3752
msgid "最短距离 `1.5 Å`；要求有限晶胞"
msgstr "Minimum distance `1.5 Å`; require a finite cell"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:41
#: 273dca8ab3df49b3aadba07e16e0d9c9
msgid "筛掉明显碰撞或无效晶胞"
msgstr "Remove obvious collisions and invalid cells"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:58
#: 90f5c21669eb49c592f2644aa5a7e175
msgid ""
"掺杂元素输入框不是 JSON。单一元素直接写 `Ge`；多元素比例写 "
"`Ge:0.7,C:0.3`。界面恢复已保存参数时也会保持这种写法，便于直接照着修改。"
msgstr ""
"The dopant field does not use JSON. Enter `Ge` for one element or "
"`Ge:0.7,C:0.3` for a multi-element ratio. Restored settings keep this "
"editable notation so you can copy and adjust it directly."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:60
#: 5b6f45c203b74059ad408c99e2ab5ac2
msgid "线性链和 Card Group 不要混淆"
msgstr "Do Not Confuse a Sequential Chain with Card Group"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:62
#: 1875e35099754970a9430e63d4c287b1
msgid ""
"顶层卡片是**串行**的：`Super Cell` 的输出进入 `Card Group`，分支汇总结果再进入 `Atomic "
"Perturb`，最后交给 `Geometry Filter`。所以扩胞应放在缺陷生成前，筛选应放在随机生成后。"
msgstr ""
"Top-level cards run **sequentially**: the `Super Cell` output enters "
"`Card Group`, the merged branch results enter `Atomic Perturb`, and the "
"result finally goes to `Geometry Filter`. This is why supercell "
"generation belongs before defect generation and filtering belongs after "
"random generation."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:64
#: fe56931e687b40e2ad2028fc9fd4c1d1
msgid "`Card Group` 内部是**并行分支**。本例的掺杂卡和空位卡都收到同一个 16 原子 Si 超胞，它们不会前后相接："
msgstr ""
"Cards inside `Card Group` are **parallel branches**. In this example, "
"both Random Doping and Vacancy Defect receive the same 16-atom Si "
"supercell; one does not feed into the other:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:66
#: 0d792b48247e4bc492734dc4c8fe0e73
msgid ""
"                 ┌→ Random Doping ─┐\n"
"Si16 → Card Group│                  ├→ 汇总为 4 个结构\n"
"                 └→ Vacancy Defect ┘\n"
msgstr ""
"                 ┌→ Random Doping ─┐\n"
"Si16 → Card Group│                  ├→ merge into 4 structures\n"
"                 └→ Vacancy Defect ┘\n"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:72
#: f4d8920cd36b429d8103539a6b87b3c4
msgid ""
"只有“同一个输入要走几条不同路线”时才使用 `Card Group`。如果你想先掺杂、再从掺杂结构中造空位，就应把两张卡放在顶层，按 "
"`Random Doping → Vacancy Defect` 排列，而不是放进同一个组。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Card Group` only when the same input should follow several "
"independent routes. If you want to dope first and then create vacancies "
"in the doped structures, place both cards at the top level in the order "
"`Random Doping → Vacancy Defect` instead of putting them in one group."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:74
#: a2a060e5b0124d0da67dfe8c1b1715c1
msgid "运行后沿着数量检查"
msgstr "Check the Counts after Running"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:76
#: cb1ad9484b524155a331d296882de502
msgid "勾选需要参与流程的卡片，点击顶部 `Run`："
msgstr "Select the cards that should participate, then click `Run` at the top:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:78
#: 4a7dd3cd867840cca9db1f9d5900718f
msgid "卡片流程各步骤的真实输入输出数量"
msgstr "Verified input and output counts for every workflow step"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:78
#: 4a7dd3cd867840cca9db1f9d5900718f
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:83
#: c473790963f34a399471c4886e2c8179
msgid "本例真实运行结果为："
msgstr "The verified result of this example is:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:85
#: f01e101c8bea4be09c81172c93c1af29
msgid ""
"1 个 Si2\n"
"→ 1 个 Si16\n"
"→ 2 个 Si15Ge + 2 个 Si15，共 4 个分支结果\n"
"→ 8 个扰动结构\n"
"→ 几何筛选保留 8 个\n"
msgstr ""
"1 Si2 structure\n"
"→ 1 Si16 structure\n"
"→ 2 Si15Ge + 2 Si15 structures, giving 4 branch results\n"
"→ 8 perturbed structures\n"
"→ 8 structures retained by the geometry filter\n"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:93
#: 5b95a8cb52fc4ff28ced2790e3cb57e3
msgid ""
"每张卡底部都显示 `Input → Output / "
"Time`。数量从哪一步开始不符合预期，就先检查那一步，不要只看最终文件。如果某张卡输出为空，流程会停在这里，下游卡片不会继续运行。"
msgstr ""
"Each card shows `Input → Output / Time` at the bottom. If a count first "
"becomes unexpected at a particular step, inspect that step instead of "
"checking only the final file. If a card produces no output, the workflow "
"stops there and downstream cards do not run."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:95
#: e4d58967703a4dbfa0f6f2b0c6aea287
msgid "运行完成后有三种查看或导出范围："
msgstr "After the run, there are three viewing or export scopes:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:97
#: 31a23a88900a4f20a6eec84dbeeefbbf
msgid "卡片标题栏的查看、导出按钮：只处理这一张卡片的输出。"
msgstr ""
"The view and export buttons in a card title bar operate only on that "
"card's output."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:98
#: 756391d3f57d4dc98e0f4254755cb344
msgid "顶部 `View selected outputs`：合并查看所有已勾选且已经产生结果的卡片，包含中间步骤。"
msgstr ""
"`View selected outputs` at the top merges the outputs of all checked "
"cards that have results, including intermediate steps."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:99
#: 6636a467578c4537a27a9fb48a003b03
msgid ""
"顶部 `Save` 菜单中的 `Export final workflow output`：只保存最后完成的已启用卡片输出；`Export all"
" available card outputs` 用于保留全部中间结果。"
msgstr ""
"`Export final workflow output` in the top `Save` menu saves only the "
"output of the last completed enabled card. Use `Export all available card"
" outputs` to keep all intermediate results."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:101
#: 4652ed62dd1d41ec9bd2d4138f36f244
msgid "保存的是结构，还是流程"
msgstr "Are You Saving Structures or the Workflow?"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:103
#: 16866574cea943f1a9567e7b7f1d1f75
msgid "这两个概念必须分开："
msgstr "Keep these two concepts separate:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:105
#: 5601a762b90a4dc2841b8c3075e6aaa0
msgid "`Copy JSON` 或 `Save → Export Card Config` 保存卡片顺序、参数和启停状态，**不包含生成结构**。"
msgstr ""
"`Copy JSON` or `Save → Export Card Config` saves card order, parameters, "
"and enabled states. It **does not contain generated structures**."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:106
#: 80892b729de243a68396f39cd6df3f8c
msgid "`Paste JSON` 会把剪贴板中的单张卡片、卡片列表或完整流程追加到当前工作区，不会自动清空原卡片。"
msgstr ""
"`Paste JSON` appends a single card, a card list, or a complete workflow "
"from the clipboard to the current workspace. It does not clear existing "
"cards."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:107
#: a4a41b111e114911baeff630c2741d04
msgid "`Load → Import Card Config` 用于从 JSON 文件恢复流程。"
msgstr "Use `Load → Import Card Config` to restore a workflow from a JSON file."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:108
#: 2e192dc75a524cafa4c5bc81fc622f7c
msgid "导出卡片输出或最终流程输出，保存的才是结构数据。"
msgstr ""
"Exporting a card output or the final workflow output is what saves "
"structure data."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:110
#: 2aead3356fe840e4acdb3520c7f35071
msgid ""
"第一次把流程调通后，建议保存一份流程 "
"JSON。更换输入结构时先检查元素、原子数和晶胞是否仍满足这些参数，再运行；不要把同一份流程配置当作所有材料都适用的物理方案。"
msgstr ""
"After the workflow works as intended, save a copy of its JSON. When "
"changing the input structures, check that their elements, atom counts, "
"and cells still fit these parameters before running. A reusable workflow "
"configuration is not a physically valid recipe for every material."

